{{apichanges|8.2.5|prev=8.2.0|next=8.3.0}}

==Changes==
* TOC: <code>80205</code>
* {{api|C_FriendList.SendWho}}() is hardware event protected.
* {{api|SendChatMessage}}() is partially hw event protected:
:: "CHANNEL" is protected, "SAY", "YELL" are protected while outside of instances/raids. <ref>{{ref web|url=https://twitter.com/deadlybossmods/status/1176685822223011842|author=Deadly Boss Mods|date=2019-09-25|title=SendChatMessage restrictions|quote=''Ok, a bunch of addon authors got to bottom of it after tons of testing. SendChatMessage automation disabled in public/private chat channels It’s ALSO disabled from SAY/YELL out in world. It’s permitted in raid/party/guild chat, and SAY/YELL within instances.''}}</ref>
* Added [[Patch_8.2.5#Making_it_Easier_to_Party_Up_with_Friends|Party Sync]] and revamped [[Patch_8.2.5#Recruit_A_Friend_Returns|Recruit-A-Friend]]
* Deprecated API: [https://www.townlong-yak.com/framexml/8.2.5/Blizzard_Deprecated/Deprecated_8_2_5.lua Deprecated_8_2_5.lua]

